/-!
# Constructible topology

In this file we define the constructible topology on a topological space. This is the topology
generated by compact open subsets and their complements.

## Main definitions and results

- `WithConstructibleTopology`: `X` equipped with its constructible topology.
- `compactSpace_withConstructibleTopology`: If `X` is quasi-separated, quasi-sober,
  prespectral and quasi-compact, then `X` is still quasi-compact in the constructible topology.

## TODOs

- If `X` is a spectral space, show that `X` is T2 and totally disconnected (@chrisflav).
-/

@[expose] public section

variable {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X]

/--
Definition of `constructibleTopologySubbasis` / `constructibleTopologySubbasis` 的定义

English:
definition constructibleTopologySubbasis
  signature: (X : Type*) [TopologicalSpace X]
  body: { s | IsOpen s ∧ IsCompact s } union { s | IsClosed s ∧ IsCompact sᶜ }

中文:
定义 constructibleTopologySubbasis
  签名: (X : 类型) [拓扑空间 X]
  定义体: { s | IsOpen s ∧ IsCompact s } union { s | IsClosed s ∧ IsCompact sᶜ }

Depends on / 依赖: IsClosed, IsCompact, IsOpen
-/
def constructibleTopologySubbasis (X : Type*) [TopologicalSpace X] : Set (Set X) :=
  { s | IsOpen s ∧ IsCompact s } union { s | IsClosed s ∧ IsCompact sᶜ }

/-- The constructible topology on a topological space `X` has as a subbasis
the open and compact sets of `X` and their complements. -/
@[instance_reducible]
/--
Definition of `constructibleTopology` / `constructibleTopology` 的定义

English:
definition constructibleTopology
  signature: (X : Type*) [TopologicalSpace X]
  body: .generateFrom (constructibleTopologySubbasis X)

中文:
定义 constructibleTopology
  签名: (X : 类型) [拓扑空间 X]
  定义体: .generateFrom (constructibleTopologySubbasis X)

Depends on / 依赖: constructibleTopologySubbasis, generateFrom
-/
def constructibleTopology (X : Type*) [TopologicalSpace X] : TopologicalSpace X :=
  .generateFrom (constructibleTopologySubbasis X)

/-- A type synonym for `X` that is equipped with the constructible topology of `X`. -/
@[nolint unusedArguments]
/--
Definition of `WithConstructibleTopology` / `WithConstructibleTopology` 的定义

English:
abbreviation WithConstructibleTopology
  signature: (X : Type*) [TopologicalSpace X]
  body: WithTopology X (constructibleTopology X)

中文:
缩写 WithConstructibleTopology
  签名: (X : 类型) [拓扑空间 X]
  定义体: WithTopology X (constructibleTopology X)

Depends on / 依赖: WithTopology, constructibleTopology
-/
abbrev WithConstructibleTopology (X : Type*) [TopologicalSpace X] : Type _ :=
  WithTopology X (constructibleTopology X)

